    &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;
        &lt;td&gt;
            Intel:&lt;br&gt;
            &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Linux: HD Graphics 510 or higher&lt;br&gt;
            &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Windows: Skylake or newer with QuickSync encoding support
